A few things don't look right to me when I compare this to how we actually classify escalations.

First, the severity labels — we use **Sev1, Sev2, Sev3**, not P1/P2/P3. That needs to change so downstream systems recognize the values.

Second, the `responseMode` output is wrong. It should always be **"Draft"** regardless of severity level. We never send customer acknowledgements automatically — they always go to a human for review first. `immediate`, `urgent`, and `standard` aren't valid values for us.

